WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Inspect the product and variant
Check the workspace. Match the name, SKU, brand and state before opening
a product. A saved parent product is separate from a purchasable, active
and priced variant.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Read physical, reserved and available stock
Check the workspace. On hand, reserved and available are different
quantities. Match the SKU and location; scroll wide tables in the system
to see the remaining columns.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Use catalog reference data
The parent column distinguishes a top-level category from a child. Check
the name, slug and state before assigning products.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Check configuration boundaries
Read editable fields and platform-controlled values separately. A
displayed setting does not by itself prove a related workflow is
enabled.

